# Planted bugs for the checked design. Each one must make its property fail.
run fv-tlc Reconciler.tla ResourceVersionCheck.cfg WitnessConverges.cfg
properties NeverOvershoots EventuallyConverges
file Reconciler.tla

mutation the checked loop creates replicas without recording that it did
detects NeverOvershoots
-           /\ expectedCreates' = expectedCreates + gap
+          /\ expectedCreates' = expectedCreates

mutation the cache stays possible to sync but nothing ever requires it
detects EventuallyConverges
- Work == ReconcileStale \/ ReconcileChecked \/ SyncCache
- Next == Work \/ Done
+ Work == ReconcileStale \/ ReconcileChecked
+ Next == Work \/ SyncCache \/ Done

harmless a comment on the checked reconcile action
- \* Source: controller.reconcile(), subtracting creates it already issued
+ \* Source: controller.reconcile(). It subtracts creates it already issued
